rtant part of the process as  well where you're lifting the pizza up  right to the gel for the oven where it's  so the heat is circulating and capping  once you're at a point where you can  dome you have a really good  understanding from where the pies at how  much longer you need to relieve  the pizzas usually take around 90  seconds  I grew up along Allen so I was sort of  surrounded by you know that  italian-american style you know pizza  place pasta place and what we wanted to  try and do here was sort of create that  environment where everyone was welcome  from all walks of life it was sort of a  place that anyone could come  you know we're open throughout the day  from 11:00 a.m. until midnight seven  days a week 365 days a year you know  that was always our intention here was  to have a really really solid  well-crafted well-made food but also to  like bring a community together bring  people together and have a good time  [Music]  [Music]

